Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 21:56:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Batch 3: let the structure say what the two scripts were
 hiding

Fixes ALL-MODU0002, ALL-MODU0005, ALL-CLAS0001, ALL-CLAS0004, ALL-FUNC0001,
ALL-FUNC0008, ALL-BRAN0001, ALL-CONT0001, ALL-CONT0003, ALL-REAC0002 and
PY-CLAS0003. The two scripts become the mcp package with one class per module,
the twelve-field configuration splits into an identity, a configuration and a
run counter, the pass-through transport hierarchy and the factory-of-a-factory
go, and the last two if-chains become one dispatch mapping.
